        "en": "Use Cigol devices to combine professional electrical installations with intelligent control and automation in Homey. \r\n\r\nCigol Connect integrates existing LK IHC switches and outputs, allowing installed wiring and modules to remain in use while adding flexible everyday control and Flows.",
